: [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!"}, "type": "feedback"}], "type": "RSLT", "template_override": 1, "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "responses": [{"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct": 0, "selected": 0, "id": 0}, {"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct": 1, "selected": 0, "id": 1}], "id": 0}]}, {"stimuli_ids": [], "id": 11, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " \nMake a list of useful time-saving techniques for busy people.\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.\n", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1, "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "engenn10le18ob05re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}]}], "responses": [{"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct": 1, "selected": 0, "id": 0}], "id": 0}]}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "template_override": 1, "contents": [{}]}, {"_data": [], "id": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn10le18ob05re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn10le18ob05re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn10le18ob05re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn10le18ob05re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Ted</span>:  Good evening, Pamela.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Pamela</span>: Hi, Ted! Nice to see you back at Toastmasters. You had been attending meetings every month for a while last year. Then, you stopped.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ted</span>: Yes, I had been going regularly, but gave it up for a time.  Now I'm back.  Hopefully, I will stay this time.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Pamela</span>: Why did you stop coming?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ted</span>: I had been trying to catch up on so many things. Between my work, family obligations and cooking meals, I didn't have any time left.  I didn't know what to do. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Pamela</span>:  But you're here now, so what's changed?"}, {"time": "28000", "image": "engenn10le18ob05re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Ted</span>: It's interesting that you ask. Nobody told me how to organize time. I read a book by this guru of time management. It was a call to action for me. According to him, most people don't pay enough attention to establishing priorities. Too often, they pursue short-term goals. The trick is to move from doing what is urgent to what is important. I had been spending too much time putting out fires. I'm going to plan my time better from now on.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Pamela</span>: Everyone has to eat. I'd say that is urgent.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ted</span>: It only becomes urgent when you have nothing left in your fridge and all the stores are closed. What is important is planning your meals so you can reduce the time involved in shopping and cooking. The book explains very well what to do."}, {"time": "71000", "image": "engenn10le18ob05re2img03.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Pamela</span>: Can you suggest where to get a copy of that book? I want to read it.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ted</span>: I'll lend you mine. Another secret is making routines that match your priorities, and sticking to them. For example, when you plan when and where you will exercise during the week, it frees up time and energy required to take action in other areas. I had been wasting a lot of time trying to do things without proper planning.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Pamela</span>: I think you know what to say for your next Toastmaster's speech.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ted</span>: Yes. I'm up next, as a matter of fact."}]}}], "title": "", "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}